From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:22:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] browse: restore source positions and animate real swipe pages

Replace post-release callbacks with native pager geometry and stable source/mode/query saveable keys. Detail continuation follows the finger, settles or cancels before handoff, and resets on Activity return.

Shared components match mihon-harmony 0099. Keep app-specific metadata, source filters and player selection; migration/recommendation consumers retain the cached single-list API.
